Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.04,0:22:30.29,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.29,0:22:33.09,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.09,0:22:36.05,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.05,0:22:38.30,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.55,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.55,0:22:44.10,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.10,0:22:46.97,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,55,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.97,0:22:49.48,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,55,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.48,0:22:52.60,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.60,0:22:56.65,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.77,0:23:02.91,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.40,0:23:09.08,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.20,0:23:11.58,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.58,0:23:14.71,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.71,0:23:20.67,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,60,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.80,0:23:24.80,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,60,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.47,0:23:27.85,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.77,0:23:38.94,ED - JP - EP07,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur0.6}きっと誰かの光だから
